#NEXUS

[ jasinski2020a_fig3: Rectangular time tree under a stage bar, with coloured range ovals at the tips, silhouettes joined to some names by dashed lines, a grey 'North American Dromaeosaurid Gap' band and continent outlines below. Polytomies: Dromaeosauridae (five), the unenlagiines below Rahonavis (five), Microraptorinae (six) and Dromaeosaurus-Boreonykus-Baynshire. Clade names printed on stems are kept on their nodes. 38 tips, 4 polytomies (5, 5, 6, 3 children); 9 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 10 case (census 3, seed 20261274). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

